stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: createTender() by PSU Officer

    Created --> UnderEvaluation: openBids() by Keeper after openingTime
    Created --> Cancelled: cancelTender() by PSU Officer

    state UnderEvaluation {
        [*] --> BidsOpened
        BidsOpened --> BidsRevealed: revealBid() by Vendor within revealDeadline
        BidsRevealed --> TechnicallyEvaluated: setTechnicalScore() by PSU Officer
        TechnicallyEvaluated --> AwardReady: All bids scored
    }

    UnderEvaluation --> Awarded: awardTender() by PSU Officer with L1 Enforcement
    UnderEvaluation --> Cancelled: cancelTender() by PSU Officer

    Awarded --> Disputed: disputeTender() by Vendor with 0.01 ETH Bond
    Awarded --> Finalized: finalizeTender() by Keeper after 7 days standstill

    state Disputed {
        [*] --> GrievanceUnderReview
        GrievanceUnderReview --> Upheld: resolveDispute(upheld) by CVC Auditor
        GrievanceUnderReview --> Dismissed: resolveDispute(dismissed) by CVC Auditor
        GrievanceUnderReview --> TimeoutDismissed: resolveDisputeTimeout() after 14 days
    }

    Upheld --> UnderEvaluation: Winner reset, award revoked, bond refunded
    Dismissed --> Awarded: Bond forfeited to treasury, standstill resumes
    TimeoutDismissed --> Awarded: Bond refunded to vendor, standstill resumes

    Finalized --> [*]: Refunds credited; Vendors call withdraw()
    Cancelled --> [*]: Refunds credited; Vendors call withdraw()
